Exemplos:<br />
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;"<span style="font-family: courier;">BUSCA1 BUSCA2"</span><br />
<span style='font-size: 1.2em; font-weight: bold; display: block; margin-top: 6px;'>Várias Buscas</span>
